# Code navigation

**Before searching the whole repo**, read [`docs/code-map.md`](docs/code-map.md) for file locations and patterns. Product/deploy/Iran rules stay in `CLAUDE.md`.

## Quick lookup

| Task | File |
|---|---|
| Business data / reads | `web/lib/store.ts` |
| DB schema + hydration | `web/lib/db/persistence.ts` |
| Auth / roles | `web/lib/auth.ts` |
| Bracket / draw | `web/lib/bracket.ts` (+ `bracket-team.ts` for 2v2) |
| Ranking | `web/lib/ranking.ts` |
| Competition cards + covers | `web/app/competitions/cards.tsx` |
| Home sliders | `promo-slider.tsx`, `news-slider.tsx` · admin `/admin/content` |
| AI assistant | `web/app/api/assistant/route.ts` |
| Shared UI | `web/components/ui.tsx` |

## Vocabulary

- **رویداد** = `Competition` (mother) → `/competitions/e/[id]`
- **رشته** = `Event` (discipline) → `/competitions/[id]`

## Blob rule

Image bytes in Postgres; RAM holds IDs only. Pages use `/api/*/ [id]` — never inline base64.

## Exploration discipline

1. Check `docs/code-map.md` quick lookup first.
2. Use targeted `grep`/`glob` — don't read whole directories.
3. Read only files on the path to the change.
4. Update `docs/code-map.md` after adding a major feature area.
